                <pb facs="1494" n="1478" sameAs="frus:frus1951v01/pg1478"/>

                <head>VI. The Question of Belgian Restrictions Placed on Imports from the Dollar
                    Area (the Sixth Session of the Contracting Parties to GATT)</head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Another question of close interest to the United States at the Sixth Session of
                    the Contracting Parties of GATT and on which
                    the United States took a vigorous initiative was the matter of Belgian
                    restrictions placed on imports from the dollar area.</p>


































